id: hac-bwr0
title: Release dry-run runner omits mandatory verification tools
description: "The manually dispatched Release Dry Run workflow invokes release:verify on a clean ubuntu-latest runner without first installing ripgrep or Trivy, so the non-publishing rehearsal cannot complete."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[4]: ci,release,security,workflow
created_at: "2026-07-25T01:14:08.669Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-25T01:20:28.662Z"
deadline: "2026-07-26T01:14:08.669Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-25T01:20:27.964Z"
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: release-dry-run.yml installs ripgrep and ShellCheck plus pinned Trivy before dependencies; workflow contract tests cover the required setup ordering; exact-head hosted Release Dry Run passes every gate and uploads its notes preview
definition_of_ready: Hosted run 30137766759 provides a clean-runner reproduction; publication workflow contains a proven setup pattern
goal: best-agent-home-assistant-cli
objective: restore-release-dry-run-parity
value: Make the manual non-publishing rehearsal a trustworthy release gate.
impact: Prevents false confidence and guarantees the full verifier can execute before publication.
outcome: A green exact-head Release Dry Run on a clean GitHub runner.
why_now: "The user explicitly requires fully working automatic release readiness, and the exact-head rehearsal failed."
parent: hac-r2z9
reviewer: unbraind
risk: high
confidence: 100
sprint: 2026-07-websocket-streaming
release: 2026.7.25
reporter: codex-root
severity: high
environment: "GitHub ubuntu-latest, Bun 1.3.14, workflow run 30137766759"
repro_steps: "Dispatch release-dry-run.yml on exact PR head; release:verify step 8 exits 127 because rg and trivy are not installed"
resolution: "Provisioned ripgrep, ShellCheck, and pinned Trivy in release-dry-run.yml before release:verify; added cross-workflow ordering coverage. Exact-head hosted run 30138138507 passed all gates and uploaded release notes."
expected_result: All ten release verification stages execute and the non-publishing workflow completes
actual_result: "Coverage reaches 100 percent, then security stage fails with rg: command not found and trivy: command not found"
affected_version: 2026.7.24
fixed_version: 2026.7.25
component: release-dry-run-workflow
regression: true
customer_impact: Maintainers cannot prove a release candidate on a clean runner before publishing.
