close_reason: "Release Dry Run now provisions the full mandatory verifier toolchain. Focused workflow tests, YAML parsing, PM integrity, PR checks, and exact-head hosted run 30138138507 all pass; the non-publishing notes artifact was uploaded."
body: "The release verifier intentionally requires rg, ShellCheck, and Trivy. publish.yml already installs the exact toolchain; release-dry-run.yml must maintain parity so its advertised rehearsal is meaningful."
